Every time I have the opportunity to visit Paris, I feel like it is like a living dream.[ Its] magic emanates from the historic buildings[,] cobble streets[, chic restaurants and] sumpt[uous] monuments. A[ real] treat for any history, art or architecture lovers. Ooohh and[ the] food. I don’[t] need to say more.
